              "message": "`no-upstream-restatement.md` is registered here and also cited by the updated impl-plan/types review prompts, but the file is not part of the tracked diff (`git ls-files` returns nothing; `git diff --stat` shows only the 12 modified files). A fresh checkout of this branch will therefore have distribution-target references to a missing convention file. Add `knowledge/conventions/no-upstream-restatement.md` to the tracked change set.",
